+	default n
+	help
+	  TOUCH-I0-DIAG (display/touch investigation mission follow-on,
+	  2026-08-01+): DIAGNOSTIC ONLY - observes whether GPIO79/pendown-
+	  gpios can generate usable IRQ events at all. This is NOT a
