+	  that, a separate, independently-gated option) - the diagnostic IRQ
+	  handler here does zero I2C transfers and zero coordinate
+	  processing, ever; it only updates in-memory counters. The existing
+	  30ms poll remains the sole touch-reporting path, permanently and
+	  unconditionally.
+
+	  Requests a FALLING-edge trigger (touch-down only) - finalized from
+	  real live evidence (a full TOUCH-D0-DIAG hardware qualification run
